{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35865","headline":"和友人喜相遇十首 三 · 李咸用","name":"和友人喜相遇十首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"惠子休惊学五车，沛公方起斩长蛇。\n六雄互欲吞诸国，四海终须作一家。\n自古经纶成世务，暂时朱绿比朝霞。\n人生心口宜相副，莫使尧阶草势斜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李咸用","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35865.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35865","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}